# 1️⃣ Authentication

## 1. Register Customer

### POST

```http
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
```

Body → raw → JSON:

```json
{
  "name": "Test Customer",
  "email": "customer1@test.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "customer"
}
```

### المتوقع

```text
201 Created
```

والـResponse فيه:

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "token": "..."
}
```

**انسخ الـtoken وحطه عندك باسم:**

```text
customerToken
```

---

