# 1️⃣6️⃣ Update Order Status

دلوقتي الـOrder حالته:

```text
Pending
```

## 30. Pending → Confirmed

### PATCH

```http
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/orders/ORDER_ID/status
```

Headers:

```text
Authorization: Bearer OWNER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json
```

Body:

```json
{
  "status": "Confirmed"
}
```

المتوقع:

```text
200
```

---

## 31. Confirmed → Preparing

نفس الـURL:

```json
{
  "status": "Preparing"
}
```

المتوقع:

```text
200
```

---

## 32. Preparing → OutForDelivery

```json
{
  "status": "OutForDelivery"
}
```

المتوقع:

```text
200
```

---

## 33. OutForDelivery → Delivered

```json
{
  "status": "Delivered"
}
```

المتوقع:

```text
200
```

كده اختبرنا الـworkflow كامل.

